    Standard 400 km LEO thermal and radiation profile. Balance solar array output
    against 35% eclipse phases and downlink during the 25% comm window.


    OPERATIONS:
    Equip a CAMERA payload, verify mass & power margins in the Hangar, and configure
    A.S.T.R.A. autopilot before launch.'
