  m_Text: 'Analyze Martian atmosphere with a Spectrometer. Solar flux is 43%, a solar
    flare hits on Orbit 3, and signal delay is 10s.


    FLIGHT ADVISORY: Deep-space
    solar flux drops to 100% and 10s signal delay prevents manual intervention. Autonomous
    fault-protection rules are mandatory.


    OPERATIONS: Equip a SPECTROMETER
    payload, verify mass & power margins in the Hangar, and configure A.S.T.R.A.
    autopilot before launch.'
